# The Emissary Windurst at status 2 (a GM), logging into Heaven's Tower, then a warp to Port Windurst and back to
# Heaven's Tower with the zone-in left open. The zone-in plays 42; its update (the RoV mission is Resonance, not The
# Path Untraveled) answers with parameter 8 = 0; its finish moves to status 3. The last warp pair plays nothing, since
# status 3 has no zone-in arm.
lists Giddeus/Uu_Zhoumo/onTrigger Giddeus/Uu_Zhoumo/onTrade Giddeus/onEventFinish/40 Giddeus/onEventFinish/41 HeavensTower/Kupipi/onTrigger HeavensTower/onZoneIn/1 HeavensTower/onEventUpdate/42 HeavensTower/onEventFinish/42 HeavensTower/onEventFinish/239 NorthernSanDoria/Helaku/onTrigger PortWindurst/Ada/onTrigger PortWindurst/Gold_Skull/onTrigger PortWindurst/Josef/onTrigger PortWindurst/Melek/onTrigger PortWindurst/onEventFinish/53 PortWindurst/onEventFinish/55
char zone=HeavensTower pos=2,0.1,30 job=WAR lvl=30 nation=1
mission Rov Resonance current
mission Bastok TheEmissaryWindurst current
login
missionstatus Bastok 2
warp 2,0.1,30 PortWindurst
warp 2,0.1,30 HeavensTower open
update 42 option=0
finish
warp 2,0.1,30 PortWindurst
warp 2,0.1,30 HeavensTower
